    "title": "'Dune's Denis Villeneuve to Direct Next James Bond Film - NewsBreak",
    "text": "‘Dune’s Denis Villeneuve to Direct Next James Bond Film\nBy Matt Singer,34 minutes ago\nAfter years of waiting, the 26th James Bond movie has finally made some progress: It’s got a director — Dune’s Denis Villeneuve. Amazon MGM, the new studio overseeing the franchise, announced the news today. According to Deadline, Villeneuve isn’t quite ready to begin work on the film just yet;. His third and final Dune film, Dune Messiah, “is shooting this summer and slated for release on December 16, 2026.”\nComments\nLoading editor...",
